A plan path that does not exist in the vault is one error line at exit 1, nothing on stdout.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
latest_migration: 9999
-- cmd --
booping correction list --plan plans/q/index.md
-- exit --
1
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
error: plan not found: plans/q/index.md
